WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:03.810
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.880
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.470
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:15.550
Well, well, well, you've all given
someone a present, right?

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.550
You wonder if they'll be happy to get it,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.560
and you feel like you've put
all your feelings into it.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.230
In my case, it's this stage.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.560
If I could give all the people
who've come to watch us

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.430
and all the companions who've
given it their best with me

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.560
a stage that they could smile and say
"That was great" about,

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.300
that would be so awesome!

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.770
I mean... I mean...

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.970
I am a Kaleido Star! Star! Star!

