00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.400
98...

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.130
The daytime practice isn't enough on its own?

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:49.100
It's nowhere near enough.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:05.690
The Amazing Injured Swan

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:08.720
The Amazing Injured Swan

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:08.720
"The Amazing Injured Swan"

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:11.620
The Amazing Injured Swan

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:18.330
If you over train that much,
of course it's going to hurt.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.500
Yes, ma'am...

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.670
Because you're trying to force your body
to compensate for the basics you lack,

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.310
you're working your feet too hard.

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:31.280
I see, your center of gravity is unstable, and
you're controlling that with the tips of your toes.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:33.470
These blood blisters are huge.

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:37.380
You should really rest your feet for a few days...

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.710
I don't have time for...

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.620
Okay, okay.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:44.130
Then how about we at least protect
the affected parts

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.530
so you don't put too much weight on them?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.360
Please!

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.420
Maybe we should put balance work
on your training menu too.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:04:00.740
One, two, three, one, two, three,
one, two, three, one, two, three,

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:06.480
one, two, three, one, two, three,
one, two, three,

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:14.120
one, two, three, one, two, three,
one, two, three, one, two, three,

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:14.390
one, two, three, one, two, three,

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:17.160
Hey, I've got a question for you.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:17.160
one, two, three, one, two, three,

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:17.990
What?

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:17.990
one, two, three, one, two, three,

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.760
What scene will Rosetta be in?

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:21.790
She won't be in this.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.500
What do you mean she won't be in it?

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:30.630
There WAS originally a diabolo scene
in the script, but she withdrew.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:35.710
It was a scene Mia put in specifically for Rosetta,

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:39.270
so it was superfluous to the story, and we cut it.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.250
Does Sora know this?

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:42.410
Yes.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.720
Stop!

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:49.260
Sorry, but I'm going to rethink this
configuration again.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:52.520
Will everybody please drop this
and switch to individual practice?

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.230
What's the problem?

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:55.990
This is the third time!

00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:00.090
Oh, I have someone I want to
introduce to you two.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:06.840
My feet hurt, but I feel like I'm getting
a better and better grip on this.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.000
I want to practice more and more!

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.180
Sorry I'm late!

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:15.780
We'll resume your special training this afternoon.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:17.650
Rest until I tell you that you can start again.

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.280
Okay...

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.450
Welcome, all you gloomy housewives!

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:28.750
Save your gloomy expressions
for your old, tired husbands.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.770
When you're with me,
show me your maidenly smiles!

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.930
I'm asking this knowing that it won't happen.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:40.240
You'd think there'd be SOME training goods
geared toward Sora's problems...

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:44.350
This guy's got a sharp tongue,
but he's pretty handsome,

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.680
so it's just hard to hate him somehow.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.550
Everything is squeaky clean with Clean Finish!

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.120
From your children's doodles

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.060
to the past doings you can't
tell your husbands about,

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:56.080
everything's wiped away in no time!

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:00.590
Come on, do a little serious help and...

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.970
Go on to the next pile of garbage, Junk Baron!

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:06.730
It isn't garbage, it's treasure!

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:08.100
It's Anna's dad!

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.100
Huh?

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.170
WHAT?!

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.370
They don't look a thing alike!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.340
This is our next treasure.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:17.450
With this, that flabby flesh will firm right up!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.840
This is it!

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:20.780
Jack!

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.420
Sorry I'm late, Anna!

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.250
Wow, it's the real Jack Baron!

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.630
It looks like work is going well.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:37.070
Yeah. The comedy channel has asked me
if I'll do a half hour program.

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:38.830
Amazing!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.140
You'll be busy, then.

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:43.640
I'll definitely help you out.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:47.180
If I refused a request from my beloved savior,
God would be sure to punish me.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:48.730
Savior?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.780
Anna is my angel.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:01.060
I'm ready!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.790
It, like, looks like the lesson is
finally going to start.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:05.760
Wasn't that a long break?

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:09.090
Perhaps that means they're close to
perfecting the Angel's Maneuver.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.960
This will be the final stage of the
special training for the Angel's Maneuver.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:14.700
Already?

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.870
I knew it.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.040
What's the matter? Hurry up.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.340
Right!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.490
I'll change the way I channel
my strength each time.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:36.060
You sense that and adjust for it.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.580
Right!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.960
Let's report this.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:40.960
Yes.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.330
Like, farewell.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:46.060
Huh?

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.670
Again, please!

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.410
Rosetta.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:57.980
What?

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.950
I hear you're not going to perform in Swan Lake?

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:03.420
That's right.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.850
This show is an important one for Sora,

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:09.620
so I don't want to get in the way
with an unnecessary scene.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:12.230
Hmmm, how adult.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.390
But considering your lofty intentions,

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.300
you seem to be sneaking around a lot
peeking at everybody's practice.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:19.430
It's none of your business, is it?

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:23.300
If you're all right with that, then fine, but...

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:26.140
I've already made my decision.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:44.460
Amazing... The Angel's Maneuver
has really started to take shape.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:49.690
But her balance seems to be getting
worse and worse. Why is that?

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:06.850
It's okay for someone unattractive
to play a handsome man.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.580
But the opposite is pretty difficult.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.420
Especially with someone as handsome as me!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.990
But you can take anything and
push it over the top,

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:17.590
and it will become funny.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:37.080
The stage direction is being outdone
by Sora's energy!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.010
Right now it's nothing but a nice little
setup that follows the rules.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.620
The only ones who will accept
this kind of textbook construction

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.050
are the professional critics!

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.350
It has to be more...

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:05.830
Hold that pose and maintain it!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.840
Right!

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:42.210
That's enough.

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:44.110
The Angel's Maneuver training is over.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.340
What?

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:49.180
Mr. Leon, what do you mean, "over"?

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:51.390
The Angel's Maneuver is perfected.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:55.050
Now spend your time until opening day
fine-tuning it and resting your body.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.080
Perfected?

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.290
Don't worry about me, I'll keep going!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.160
Mr. Leon, please wait!

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:06.090
It's over now? That can't be...

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:22.150
You're saying you're going to break off
the Angel's Maneuver training?

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:24.190
Even at her current level,

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.220
I would think she can maintain it
for five minutes.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:30.730
And if she saves her strength,
she can manage the two daily shows.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:31.990
It's enough.

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:35.130
Can you really call that the Angel's Maneuver?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.270
She's compensating for her
lack of basic balance

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:40.860
by forcibly holding the poses
with her leg strength.

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:44.840
In that sense I can't call it the real thing,
but the audience won't know.

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.970
That doesn't satisfy me.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:50.040
If she overextends herself, the show will fail.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:55.850
You can just think about giving it the widest
publicity you can and raking in the profits.

00:11:55.850 --> 00:12:00.080
Can you make good on your promise
to your little sister like that?

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:05.890
It's none of your business.

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:19.910
Sora?! Hey, what happened?

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:21.280
Where's Leon?

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.680
He said my special training was over.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:24.950
I see...

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.970
But that can't be right.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.240
He gave up on me.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.950
Show me your feet.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.490
What is this?!

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.930
Your balance was getting worse,
so I thought something was off.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:45.020
You've torn the skin from your toes!

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:48.470
If you've come this far and Leon's
given you the okay, isn't that enough?!

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:50.070
It's no good at all!

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:52.900
Like this, it's completely...

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:58.710
There's no way I can wake up everybody's
angel hearts with a maneuver at this level.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.050
Like!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.490
The special training is over?

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:08.490
Yes, miss.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:10.390
That's definitely what Leon said.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.490
But Sora...

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.730
...like, didn't seem to accept that.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.460
I see.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:22.530
Miss, you're so beautiful!

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.180
From the reports of her training
I've heard up until now,

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:36.080
Leon has minimized balance training

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.710
and spent that time strengthening
her legs instead.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:45.320
He's trying to modify the Angel's Maneuver into
something she can do at her current ability level.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:49.200
But there's no way Sora would
accept a fake like that;

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.490
something that's only
the appearance of the thing.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:57.060
If Leon can't completely become a demon,
there's only one way left.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:01.230
The angel herself has to become a demon, Sora.

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:07.250
The Angel's Maneuver is
going to be changed out?!

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.150
If that happens, we'll have to rework
the entire stage plan!

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:11.920
How is Sora doing?

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.850
We're making her get treatment for her feet.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.490
She's ripped up the skin of her toes,

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:19.160
and in this condition she can't
give a proper performance.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.860
But...

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.600
I can still go on.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:27.000
I can still DO it!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.400
Do your feet still hurt?

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.060
Enough of this. I'll be back!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.110
Sora, where are you going?

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:39.580
I'm going to try asking Mr. Leon one more time
if he'll continue my training.

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.620
Sora...

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:41.950
Oh my, you startled me.

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:43.020
Miss Sarah!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.320
I have a delivery.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:46.250
A present from that guy over there.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:48.690
Ken got me a present?

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:52.460
Well, I was looking at catalogs and
I just kind of bought them.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.330
I couldn't resist, so I bought some too!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:03.170
I thought I'd recommend it to Leon
as a method of improving her balance

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.500
while not putting too much of
a burden on her feet, but...

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:12.380
I've decided I'm definitely going to ask Mr. Leon
to continue my training.

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:15.580
So I'll try recommending this too!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:18.140
Because the special training isn't over!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.530
What are you doing?

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.400
I thought I told you to rest.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:31.400
Mr. Leon, please continue my training.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:32.730
Please.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.140
There's no need.

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.970
The Angel's Maneuver has been perfected.

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.710
That can't be true!

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:42.380
Right now it's all I can do just to somehow
fake the appearance of it.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:44.550
I don't own this maneuver at all.

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:48.250
I can't believe that I can give everyone
a good time with this.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.950
If I say it's over, it's over.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:54.960
In that case, I'll continue my training by myself.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:56.120
What?

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:58.990
I'm going to do it until I'm satisfied.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:03.230
And I WILL master the Angel's Maneuver
before opening day.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.930
So well that I'll get you to acknowledge me too.

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:07.420
Do what you want.

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:13.500
There's a limit to the amount of pain a person
can put herself through of her own will.

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:19.150
You're a fool.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.880
Shut up.

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:24.890
Obviously I won't be able to get it
right on the first try.

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:30.410
If I incorporate balance training into
my daily life like this...

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:37.220
The Fool aims for heights yet unseen.

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:40.270
First you have to get completely
used to the shoes.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.500
Right!

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.250
Rosetta, can you get the drinks?

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.120
Sure.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.250
Your balance has gotten a lot better, huh?

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.410
Yep!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:05.520
It seems as if the special training isn't over,
just as Miss Layla predicted.

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:07.550
Here it comes!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:13.800
What do you think, Sora?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:14.870
It's good!

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:16.270
Now that I'm doing this,

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:20.570
I can really tell I've been working all my muscles
unnecessarily hard this whole time.

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:22.840
Now switch legs!

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:30.480
This is the feeling of it.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.450
If I get it this way even without these shoes...

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:35.220
Here it comes again!

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:36.320
Right!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.790
Don't let your pose slip.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.090
Right!

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.090
Rosetta...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:46.670
I think I'll do balance training again
starting tomorrow.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.200
You're really fired up, huh?

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.940
Do you think you'll be able to do the
Angel's Maneuver as planned?

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.740
Of course that's what I mean to do.

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:56.280
I'll do my best, so that I can get Leon
to acknowledge me too.

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:58.110
I'm sure you can do it, Sora.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:58.950
Thanks!

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.920
I'm going to practice more too,

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:03.780
and someday I'll be onstage with you
on the trapeze.

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:05.450
I'm looking forward to it.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:11.130
I try to force myself to do it on strength alone,
so I can only do 1 00 reps.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:14.820
If my whole body is balanced,
I should be able to do more.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:25.060
She's got way more fighting spirit
than she's had up till now.

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:32.010
The really hard part is from here on out, Sora.

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:36.710
Because you can't relax your attention to
any part of your body, even for an instant.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.620
My whole body is straining...

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.850
I feel like one rep is tiring me ten reps worth.

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:47.660
The special training is moving backwards.

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:49.300
I don't get it.

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:51.920
She like, looks like she's having a
harder time than she was before.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.700
Miss!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.700
Miss Layla!

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.840
I'm all right.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:01.140
So Sora's started balance training again?

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:02.410
Yes, Miss.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.350
That's my Sora.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:08.880
But after you've learned to fake a technique,

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.720
retraining your body to do it
correctly is no easy thing.

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.250
I have to master the technique

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:17.320
of instantaneously sensing the flow
of my partner's strength soon too.

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:21.660
Because without that, the Angel's Maneuver
won't be perfected.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:31.140
Sora is... Sora is...

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:40.070
Stop!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.590
Why?

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.360
Why are you going that far?

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:55.090
Why are you and Sophie so
merciless toward yourselves?

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.430
I thought you were going to let Sora
do what she wanted.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:03.440
Every muscle in your body must be
creaking with overstrain by now.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:07.570
If you keep doing this, you'll never be
able to stand onstage again!

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:13.380
Even if that happens, I can't
show the audience something fake.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:17.350
Leon, are you telling me to
show them something fake?!

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:19.050
A fake is enough.

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:20.650
No it's not.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:24.830
With something like that, there's
no way the stage without battles...

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:29.090
Then the stage without battles
can't become real.

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:36.290
I was fighting all along, where
Sophie couldn't see me.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:42.170
I struck down those who tried to
involve Sophie in their battles!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:49.680
Leon, I'm definitely going to become a true star
and create a stage with no battles.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.050
Yeah. I'm sure you can do it, Sophie.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:54.890
When all's said and done,

00:20:54.890 --> 00:21:00.390
I never believed in this "stage with no battles"
thing for a moment.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:02.430
Now stop this.

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:05.430
It's only natural that you can't believe in it.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:08.560
Because nobody's ever seen it.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:13.610
I don't know what it's like either.

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:17.640
But that's exactly why I want to see it.

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:21.220
I want to do anything I can to make that happen.

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:29.820
I think Miss Sophie wanted to see you standing
on a stage without battles, Mr. Leon.

00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:34.090
Promise me, Leon...

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:39.690
I think that was Sophie's dream!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:45.270
Her goal of becoming a true star,
and that promise...

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:48.540
You're saying that was all for my sake?

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:56.750
Sophie probably knew all about
your fighting and...

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:11.030
Thank you.

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:14.670
I've changed my mind.

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:18.000
We'll start the special training again.

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:22.630
Yes, sir!

