00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:08.520
<i>Even I don't have a vacation,
I've got an oasis</i>

00:23:08.520 --> 00:23:14.950
<i>Keitai off tte ai o charge shite</i>

00:23:08.520 --> 00:23:14.950
<i>I'll turn off the cell phone
and charge my love</i>

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:19.800
<i>Yasashisa dake ja iyasenai itami mo aru kara</i>

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:19.800
<i>Because some pain,
you can't soothe with just kindness</i>

00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>We are alone. Surechigau</i>

00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>We are alone. We pass each other</i>

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:25.070
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:25.070
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:30.330
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:30.330
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:37.710
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:37.710
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:46.220
It looks like Sora is fighting with
something, doesn't it?

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:49.860
And so, the difference between
fighting and competing,

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:52.530
the difference between hating each other
and improving each other...

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:56.200
We know why we fight, and why
we tackle challenges.

00:23:56.200 --> 00:24:00.110
The audience's smiles are waiting for us!
They are! They are!

